    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Into The Cheeze is a yellow tower made of stacked cheese slices, with a spiral tube slide wrapping down one side. Each layer is a different climbing step, so children work their way up slice by slice and then slide back down through the cheese. It is designed for ages 5 to 12 and holds up to 15 children. The tower is compact at 13' x 8'2\" and needs a safe play area of 18'5\" x 13'7\", which suits a small society garden or preschool yard. Play on it builds upper body strength, pretend play and creative exploration. It comes in Banana Yellow. Our 3-year warranty covers galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask us how it fits your corner."
     }
    ]
